Package: audido
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Audido contributors <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/nazhifhaidarputra/audido
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libasound2, ffmpeg, yt-dlp
Description: terminal-based audio player
 Audido is a terminal user interface for local audio playback, queue
 management, YouTube playback, and DSP-based audio processing.
